# Purpose
Explains how to write handoffs with outcome, current state, next action, facts,
recommendations, and decisions already made.

# Key Sections
- When to use this guide.
- Start with the outcome.
- Describe the current state.
- Name the next action.
- Separate facts from recommendations.
- Include decisions already made.

# Dependencies
- Belongs to the productivity manual set.

# Gotchas
- Keep facts, recommendations, decisions, and unresolved questions distinct.

# Change History
- 2026-08-03: Added ACE companion.
